  { key: 'report', prompt: `Lens: REPORT ACCURACY. Check every factual claim in formal/reports/MM02_v0.3_p3.md against the module and against command output: theorem counts (90 total, 26 new), "150 named declarations", axiom lists per theorem in (g), the claim that only docstrings changed since 382ea9a, the (i) counterexample (re-run it), every quotation from the spec and from DESIGN.md (must be verbatim), every cross-reference to pass-2 report sections ((e) 1/2/3, (f) 4, (h), decision 9), and the claim in (i) that in all other cases every ub of the relation is produced by the interpreter. Check that sections (a)-(g) and (i) exist as the brief requires. Check that the report never says the semantics exists only on reachable states (arbitration). Flag wording that overclaims or underclaims.` },
  { key: 'arbitration', prompt: `Lens: ARBITRATION, SCOPE AND COMPLETENESS OF THE ANALYSIS.
